{
  "tema": 5221,
  "slug": "pude-pudo",
  "titulo": "Poder in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "Por fin pude pararme en la tabla.",
  "foto": "t06.jpg",
  "regla": "Poder is irregular in the preterite: stem pud- with unaccented endings: pude, pudiste, pudo, pudimos, pudieron. Pude means I managed to; no pude means I tried and failed.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In the preterite, **poder** changes its stem to **pud-**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "pud-",
            "+",
            "-e, -iste, -o, -imos, -ieron"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "poder"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "pude"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "pudiste"
            ],
            [
              "él / ella / usted",
              "pudo"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros / nosotras",
              "pudimos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos / ellas / ustedes",
              "pudieron"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**No written accents**: **pude**, **pudo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Meaning: **pude** = _I managed to_ (and did it). **No pude** = _I couldn't_ (I tried and failed)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "For a general ability in the past, with no specific attempt, use the imperfect: **De niño podía nadar horas.**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **pude** has a **d** like **did it**; **puse** (from poner) has an **s** like **set it**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Por fin ==pude== pararme en la tabla.",
              "en": "I finally managed to stand up on the board."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Pudiste== hablar con el mecánico?",
              "en": "Were you able to talk to the mechanic?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Holden no ==pudo== salvar el Canterbury.",
              "en": "Holden couldn't save the Canterbury."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Pudimos== cruzar la línea en veinte minutos.",
              "en": "We managed to cross the border in twenty minutes."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis amigos no ==pudieron== venir a la carne asada.",
              "en": "My friends couldn't come to the cookout."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ayer no ==pude== escapar de la guardia de mi compañero.",
              "en": "Yesterday I couldn't escape my partner's guard."
            },
            {
              "es": "Con tanta lluvia, la abuela no ==pudo== regar el huerto.",
              "en": "With so much rain, Grandma couldn't water the garden."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Ustedes ==pudieron== ver el atardecer desde el muelle?",
              "en": "Were you all able to see the sunset from the pier?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
